// Holmes County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's real estate
// search, the Clerk's eServices, the library's bookmobile page, the humane society
// and the Bargain Hunter's Holmes page) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * Discover Holmes County (discoverholmescounty.com) was dropped: it is a private
//     directory that names no operator.
//   * The Ashland County-West Holmes Career Center is now Heartland Technical
//     Education Center (heartlandtech.org).
//   * The county site still links West Holmes schools at westholmes.k12.oh.us; the
//     district's site is westholmes.org.
//   * The county's elected-officials page is partly out of date (its sheriff and
//     commissioner names differ from those offices' own sites), so descriptions
//     name no office-holders.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Holmes County FL/MS (holmescosheriff.org is Florida); Millersburg PA/KY/IN/MI;
//   Berlin Heights is Erie County; Sugarcreek and Baltic are Tuscarawas;
//   Loudonville is Ashland County; Walnut Creek CA.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * No city; Millersburg (the seat) is a village. Holmesville, Killbuck, Nashville
//     and Glenmont have no sites. Berlin, Walnut Creek, Charm and Mount Hope are
//     unincorporated.
//   * Two school districts (West Holmes, East Holmes), served by the Tri-County ESC;
//     career-tech through Heartland (West Holmes) and Buckeye Career Center (East
//     Holmes). Holmesville Elementary belongs to Southeast Local (Wayne County).
//   * Several bodies are shared with Wayne County: United Way, the Mental Health &
//     Recovery Board, the Counseling Center, NAMI and Goodwill.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * holmescountydoglicense.com (leads to an error page) and the old
//     holmescountydevelopment.org domain.
//   * The 14 townships, the village fire districts, the senior center, the YMCA
//     child care center and the Killbuck Valley Museum: no website or Facebook only.
//   * Amish and Mennonite private schools: no official sites.
//   * The Recorder's records search, court fee payments and the emergency alert
//     sign-up: vendor portals.

